Dividing both sides by $0.6$ (or 6/10), we find the value of y: \begin{align*} \dfrac{0.6y}{0.6} &= -24 \dfrac{0.6}{0.6} \\\\ y &= -40 \end{align*}Check: $4+2.3(-40)=-84$ and $1.7(-40)-20=-84$. Therefore the answer is $y = -40$.
