Total number of hoses: 3 
\begin{align*} \frac{AB + AC + BC}{2} = \frac{\frac{1}{4} + \frac{1}{5} + \frac{1}{6}}{2} = \frac{\frac{15}{60} + \frac{12}{60} + \frac{10}{60}}{2} = \frac{\frac{37}{60}}{2} = \frac{37}{120} \end{align*} 

\begin{align*} \left(\frac{37}{120}\right)^{-1} = \left(\frac{120}{37}\right) \approx 3.24 \end{align*} 

